{
  "$comment": "Paths in the words of the kit's commands: a type that declares `pathName` (a field, or a member of a json field) names its objects among the items of their list; a change inside an object a tool id holds then gives each edit `named` beside its positional `field`: the names on the way joined by `/` (the fields leading to the first and between them not written), then the path below the last; `#<n>` for an empty, numeric or unsafe name (`/. # @`), `<name>#<n>` for the n-th of one name. Run by kition-kdm (tests/changes.rs) and @kition/kdm (test/changes.test.ts) on the receipt (changes_since / changesSince). The setup's layer is numbered after it (`testing::number_tool_ids`, `numberToolIds`): its tool id is `1`.",
  "docId": "01920000-0000-7000-8000-0000000000c9",
  "schema": {
    "kdm": 1,
    "kit": "kit.paths",
    "schemaVersion": 1,
    "root": "Doc",
    "types": {
      "Doc": {
        "fields": {
          "layers": {
            "kind": "list",
            "of": "Layer"
          }
        }
      },
      "Layer": {
        "fields": {
          "id": {
            "kind": "integer",
            "readOnly": true,
            "optional": true
          },
          "props": {
            "kind": "ref",
            "of": "Node",
            "owns": true,
            "optional": true
          }
        },
        "toolId": {
          "field": "id"
        }
      },
      "Node": {
        "fields": {
          "meta": {
            "kind": "json"
          },
          "value": {
            "kind": "json",
            "optional": true
          },
          "children": {
            "kind": "list",
            "of": "Node"
          },
          "keys": {
            "kind": "list",
            "of": "Key"
          }
        },
        "pathName": "meta.match"
      },
      "Key": {
        "fields": {
          "time": {
            "kind": "string"
          },
          "value": {
            "kind": "json"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
